# Batch 08: C/GLSL frontends, inline blocks (exact rewrites; diff = UB/miscompile).
simplify this nofile
```c
unsigned f(unsigned x) { return (x * 8) / 4; }
```
simplify nofile
```glsl
uint g(uint x) { return x * 7u + 3u; }
```
SAT simplify
```c
unsigned h(unsigned x) { return (x & 15) * 3 + (x >> 4); }
```
c optimize nofile wrapv
```c
int clamp01(int x) { return x < 0 ? 0 : (x > 1 ? 1 : x); }
```
c lower nofile
```c
int sum4(int *p) { return p[0]+p[1]+p[2]+p[3]; }
```
simplify nofile, x in [0, 32)
```glsl
uint rot(uint x, uint n) { return (x >> n) | (x << ((32 - n) & 31)); }
```
simplify nofile
```c
float poly(float x) { return x*x*x + 2*x*x + 3*x + 4; }
```
